<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		361.88		vs	  349.67</p>
<p> Operating	    8.98		vs	    7.72</p>
<p> Current		5.13		vs	    2.69</p>
<p> Net		    2.21		vs	  568    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.94 yen	  vs	    0.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.13 billion	  vs	1.13 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Materials Corp is a leading manufacturer in metals and ceramics.</p>
